  $$Geneva, Switzerland$$,
  $$senior$$,
  NULL,
  $$Indian passport holder, based in Nepal on a work permit. Would need sponsorship for on-site work in the US/UK/EU. Available for direct individual contracts or through my UK-registered limited company.$$,
