  $$https://picsum.photos/seed/demo-edvania-kiala/800/200$$,
  $$Edvânia Kiala is an investment climate analyst with four years of experience in Angola and Lusophone Africa. She has supported diagnostics of business regulation and trade facilitation, built financial models for public-private partnership projects in water and logistics, and drafted policy notes on economic diversification away from oil. She previously worked in the PPP unit of the Ministry of Finance, where she reviewed project feasibility studies and value-for-money assessments. Edvânia works in Portuguese and English and is building expertise in investment promotion and special economic zones. She has also analysed customs and border procedures along the Lobito corridor.$$,
