  $$https://picsum.photos/seed/demo-onalenna-kgosietsile/800/200$$,
  $$Onalenna Kgosietsile is a data scientist working on water management and climate adaptation in Botswana and the Limpopo basin. In four years she has built Python tools to clean and analyse groundwater monitoring data, forecast reservoir levels and map drought exposure with remote sensing and GIS. She has worked with the Department of Water and Sanitation and a regional river basin commission, and enjoys making dashboards that operators actually use. Onalenna is completing an MSc in hydroinformatics and is keen to apply data science to irrigation and urban water planning. She also builds dashboards for groundwater quality and flood and drought early warning.$$,
