INSERT INTO video_responses (id, profile_id, kind, question_id, video_url, video_path, transcript, duration_seconds) VALUES
  ('ca6ed330-f76b-593a-9084-8d12e0fb7fca', 'ef9da174-4196-4a7d-950f-fb237c3e11ce', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 1 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-1.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] The project I'm proudest of is Bangladesh's primary health care investment case. I led the costing and the analysis of what the government could afford. What changed was the budget: primary care spending rose in the next two budget cycles, and the case is still used in negotiations with partners.$$, 20),
  ('c9def152-de3e-5e83-970e-d4b408d32752', 'ef9da174-4196-4a7d-950f-fb237c3e11ce', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 2 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-2.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] When I started in Lao PDR I didn't know the provincial health system at all. I spent my first two weeks in provinces, not in the ministry, and asked district officers how money actually reached them. The strategy was better for it.$$, 20),
  ('762819d6-d25e-50d9-87e8-258737adf9d1', 'ef9da174-4196-4a7d-950f-fb237c3e11ce', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 3 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-3.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] In Kenya our pricing review showed that a flagship procurement reform was not saving money. I presented it to the ministry with the data, the reasons, and two practical options, so it became a discussion about fixing the reform rather than defending it.$$, 20),
  ('ff215a16-9da9-50b4-badd-ba51deeb5cca', 'ef9da174-4196-4a7d-950f-fb237c3e11ce', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 4 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-4.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] I've worked with ministries across South Asia, Africa and Southeast Asia. I try to learn how decisions are really made in each place, and I always work with a national counterpart who co-owns the analysis and presents it.$$, 20),
  ('7e45e36d-aa80-5cf0-922f-3ee159c72254', 'ef9da174-4196-4a7d-950f-fb237c3e11ce', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 5 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-5.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] Fiscal space analysis is my core method. It's the wrong tool when the real problem is how money flows once it's in the budget; then you need a public expenditure tracking survey or a look at provider payments instead.$$, 20);
