INSERT INTO video_responses (id, profile_id, kind, question_id, video_url, video_path, transcript, duration_seconds) VALUES
  ('00a40d8b-c806-5df5-84a5-bcf0dc1fd2db', '388093d4-21e1-413a-a718-4296a10a44fc', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 1 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-1.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] The project I'm proudest of is the M&E framework for a youth employment programme in Ghana. I designed it with the partners, not for them, and for the first time the programme could see how young women's outcomes differed from young men's. It changed how two components were targeted.$$, 20),
  ('191803ab-3091-5d39-a536-a6a0283c89e3', '388093d4-21e1-413a-a718-4296a10a44fc', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 2 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-2.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] In the DRC I joined a GBV review in a province I had never worked in. I relied on local women's organisations to understand the context and the risks, and I adjusted the methods so that no survivor was put at risk by the research.$$, 20),
  ('94c1456a-f54f-5825-801e-fb327d8f5058', '388093d4-21e1-413a-a718-4296a10a44fc', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 3 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-3.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] On an FCDO programme our midline showed weak results in one country. I shared it early with the client, with the reasons and a recovery plan, and we agreed to reallocate budget rather than wait for the endline.$$, 20),
  ('ba582ca4-9098-5c3b-93db-cbece404a136', '388093d4-21e1-413a-a718-4296a10a44fc', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 4 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-4.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] I work in English, French and Swahili, and I always include national researchers in the team. Local partners know which questions people will answer honestly, and that matters more than the survey design.$$, 20),
  ('6d42dbf9-5771-56e9-8185-c57ca961482d', '388093d4-21e1-413a-a718-4296a10a44fc', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 5 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-5.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] I specialise in mixed-methods evaluation with a gender lens. It is not the right tool for a quick accountability check; if a donor only needs to know whether outputs were delivered, a lighter monitoring review is better value.$$, 20);
