INSERT INTO video_responses (id, profile_id, kind, question_id, video_url, video_path, transcript, duration_seconds) VALUES
  ('6b819919-a378-57aa-9fa6-29e1602866bf', '0b3dca45-f309-4196-b83d-8840e915a177', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 1 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-1.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] I'm proudest of Ukraine's national open data portal. I led the design with the government team. What changed is that ministries began publishing data by default, and journalists and civic tech groups built dozens of tools on top of it.$$, 20),
  ('6a46d90c-4b8c-5dfb-82d9-d0a68347d498', '0b3dca45-f309-4196-b83d-8840e915a177', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 2 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-2.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] When I started in Rwanda I didn't know the institutional landscape. I spent time with the agencies that would actually run the digital identity system and asked what had failed before. That shaped a much simpler first phase.$$, 20),
  ('426e6468-e3aa-50b7-9e27-f851121277bc', '0b3dca45-f309-4196-b83d-8840e915a177', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 3 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-3.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] In Georgia we had to tell the funder that the disclosure system would launch six months late because of a legal gap. I explained the gap, showed what we could launch early, and the funder agreed to the revised plan.$$, 20),
  ('07857ccb-1ae6-53a1-8796-065f118847f8', '0b3dca45-f309-4196-b83d-8840e915a177', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 4 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-4.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] I work in German, English, French and Russian, but I always rely on local partners for context. Civic tech groups often know where government data breaks down long before officials do.$$, 20),
  ('dea9eb1a-fdd3-55f2-a944-96d898fd8c49', '0b3dca45-f309-4196-b83d-8840e915a177', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 5 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-5.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] My core approach is user-centred design for government services. It's not the right tool when the real problem is legal or political, such as who owns the data; then you need policy work first.$$, 20);
